{"ID":"20240306172247-em9txqk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240306172247-em9txqk","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240306172247-em9txqk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312144138-err61j6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312144054-xknb5qw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2849,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312144138-yvsmdce\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:118,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:118\u0026#125;","title":"【分消汤】\u0026amp;【补气建中汤】\u0026amp;【实脾饮】\u0026amp;【补中治湿汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312145435"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312144138-err61j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-err61j6","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百四十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-6toe8lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-6toe8lr","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明中风」，脉弦浮大，而短气，腹满，胁下及心痛，久按之气不通，鼻干不得汗，嗜卧，一身面目悉黄，小便难，有潮热，时时哕，耳前后肿，刺之稍瘥。病过十日，外不解，脉续弦者，与「小柴胡汤」。脉但浮，无余证者，与「麻黄汤」。若不尿，腹满加哕者，不治。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-72pbspz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-72pbspz","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉弦浮大，弦是少阳的脉，浮是表症，大是阳明热症的脉。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阳阳明太阳都有"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-p1buhe7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-p1buhe7","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如现在有病人肝癌，肝癌肝硬化。他就是腹满，心痛，鼻干不得汗，正常人早上起来抹鼻子油油的，实际上这个你的生命啊，是三焦气机很流畅才会光光亮亮的嘛。如果鼻子都灰尘污垢，除了你去坐牢压力很大，还有就是胃气没了。常常打嗝，小便又困难，因为肚子积水了，排不出来，结果你全身是黄的，又有潮热啊，耳朵又有前后肿。“耳前后肿”耳朵一圈是少阳，我们有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"骨三阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，身上有三个阴骨，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"耳朵后面这个大骨头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"头顶的骨头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是小时候收起来的骨头，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"膝盖的骨头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，叫做"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三阴股"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-i5vseum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-i5vseum","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阳明的中风，耳前后都肿，我们身上三个阴骨，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"泥丸，就是囱骨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-d3tirny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-d3tirny","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 6——3"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-5uhx7j2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-5uhx7j2","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小孩子两三岁这个骨头开始收。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-i6131ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-i6131ly","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去，我们知道有这个东西，没有很肯定，后来黄帝外经出来就看到了里面写的骨三阴。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"临床上怎么解释？如果光看这个不知道它是做什么"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，曾经治疗血癌的时候，小朋友做化疗骨髓移植，结果做完西医宣布无治了。无治以后来找我了，给他吃中药，两个礼拜之后，小孩子胃口也开了，元气也恢复了，再回去一查，没有血癌。没有血癌的时候，西医说是他骨髓换的有效，你已经换了半年前了，做了化疗没效到我手上来的，病人快死了。结果病人家属倾向西医，又找西医治疗，到十一月的时候，有一天突然小朋友，耳朵后面高骨，肿起来一大块，这是骨三阴，代表病进入阴了，这很危险的症状。耳前后肿，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小孩子受惊吓的时候，耳朵后面有鸡爪的血脉，刺刺放点血，受惊的时候可以用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-96dvo3x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-96dvo3x","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"骨三阴如果出现实症的时候，代表阴实，为什么会造成阴实？我一再告诉他爸爸，感冒的时候一定要吃中药，绝对不可以吃抗生素，结果小孩子感冒，吃两个礼拜抗生素，吃完以后骨头就肿起来了。阴骨肿起来，病到阴实。病到阴实的时候小孩子很聪明啊，跟爸爸说我们吃倪医师的药就好，因为治好过一次啊，西医坚持不让治疗，说要再做化疗。结果他的爸爸在那模凌两可，我就跟他讲一句话，我讲这句话的目的是要救他儿子，我说这一次一定要西医写下契结书，白纸黑字写好，说我们西医没效，我再帮你动手，否则我不治疗；因为他也不会听你的话，对不对？西医治死了他不会怪西医，只会怪中医，结果呢，小朋友就死在了医院里。这病历都在我手上，本来可以不用死的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-b7rtsmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-b7rtsmk","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病进入阴实的时候，阴里面积实的时候，实症在里面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明证是阳实，简单讲就是大便堵在肠子里面而已"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。很好处理，当人你处理不好也会死。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大肠癌是不会死人的病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，但是大肠癌你开刀，大肠癌手阳明大肠经阳明经，开刀以后大肠癌移转，大肠癌如果承气汤，大柴胡汤去攻的时候，芒硝可以攻坚，肿瘤可以打开来，再严重里面结石很盛阴实很盛的话，大不了我们用巴豆，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果开刀，移转变成肝癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。从阳明证变成厥阴症，死掉了。临床上西医没有开刀，可以救的回来。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"动了刀以后，跑到肝里面去的时候，就看运气了（百分之三四十机会）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-kepmtew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-kepmtew","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“腹满，胁下及心痛，久按之气不通，鼻干不得汗，”这是很危险了，肚子胀，里面阴实结到，一身面目悉黄，眼睛都是黄的，小便难，有潮热，时时哕，常常打嗝。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看起来像阳明症，实际上，里面阴实结到了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"耳前后肿，代表病已经入阴了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有的人在头顶，大多数看是在耳朵后面，西医叫多发性骨髓瘤，这种东西长在膝盖骨里面，膝盖骨也是阴骨，西医不知道膝盖骨也是代表阴症，代表阴结实，也可以从这个地方判断病好了没有。比如说治疗骨髓瘤，骨髓瘤长得关节上都有，每个脊椎骨关节中间的间隙都长个肿瘤，长个脚膝盖肿瘤，人弯起来不能直立了，因为肿瘤长在那边。你一治疗以后人可以走，你就可以根据脚膝盖的活络情况判断好了没有。所以中医有很多诊断的方式。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-36cw7lp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-36cw7lp","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"刺之稍瘥。病过十日，外不解，脉续弦者，与「小柴胡汤」。脉但浮，无余证者，与「麻黄汤」。若不尿，腹满加哕者，不治。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遇到这种情形，没法治了。但身为医生不能真正不治，还是要抢救一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-a2ekpg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-a2ekpg3","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上看到这种肝硬化，肝癌腹水的时候，如果病人没有动过，就是没有做过切片，也没有栓塞，就是没有动过，我们已经知道他是阴实，这种情况之下，你做栓塞，阴更实。现在告诉诸位怎么治疗，前提实西医没有碰过，西医动手就没办法了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-yvsmdce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-yvsmdce","updated":"20240312144824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝产生的腹水，你不用管他肝硬化还是肝癌，一个是实症，一个是虚症。实症有个名称叫分消汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个分消汤是从《万病回春》找出来的，这个是对实症，实症上面看到的常常是肝硬化，病人精神还是很好，跟你讲话还是很有力气，颜色很暗但是没有那么虚，肚子胀的很大，脚、下焦肿起来。如果病人给西医动过，处方只有一条路，就是加重剂量，一搏嘛。临床上，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只要西医没有碰过，效果都很好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"分消汤：苍术三、白术三、茯苓三、陈皮二、厚朴二。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-364xwlf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-364xwlf","updated":"20240312144408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚症的时候用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补气建中汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，在金匮谈到，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治肝先实脾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，难就难在怎么把脾实起来。这两个处方呢实症跟虚症，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"苍术、白术、茯苓、陈皮、厚朴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这五味药是相同的，你就按照比例加上去嘛。实症加我们就加一些实脾的药，用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"香附子二，猪苓二，泽泻二，实症用枳实一，大腹皮一，西砂仁一，木香一，灯心草一把，灯心草非常轻，它是包好的，一把还不到一钱。干姜一，生姜一"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这是实症。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144426-3ihu7f3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144426-3ihu7f3","updated":"20240312145206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"分消汤如果把枳实，改为枳壳，就叫做实脾饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"，万病回春的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。枳实跟枳壳差异在那里？过去淮河以北称为枳实，淮河以南叫橘子。枳实是先采的。晚点收，里面都干掉了，就剩壳了，就叫枳壳。会用枳实，是因为他里面腹水很多，枳实能够开胃，木之实，是木的果实，味是酸的，肝木克到土，肝脏有问题的时候会克到脾土，所以腹部里会有积水。腹部是脾脏在管，所以一律是健脾利湿的药在里面。我们称为甘淡渗利。甘淡渗利为阳，辛甘发散为阳，处方的时候，麻黄桂枝下去辛甘发散为阳，甘淡通利的药也是阳药。如果肝硬化，脾脏肿大，都是用这个药。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-1l8p46h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-1l8p46h","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果病人气色变了，病人气色很暗黄，元气没有了，形没有了。瘦干干的，肚子大，这个来不及了，实症变虚症了，虚症的时候，苍术、白术、茯苓、陈皮、厚朴这五味药不变，但是其他的药要该一下。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"补气建中汤，加人参三，泽泻三，麦门冬三，黄芩二"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，前面五味药加上这四味药，叫补气建中汤。补气建中汤来自《济生方》的臌胀门，有谈到补气建中汤。当你在使用的时候，剂量药开大。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看到病人有积水的时候，马上就要用。他不是说都会中，太慢用有时候还是会来不及"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当你发现的时候，有时候"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可以加重剂量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-k0dyxy9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-k0dyxy9","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果病人告诉你很冷，心脏力量不够了，这两个处方不管是实症还是虚症，用不到甘草，因为甘草会蓄水。这个时候可以增加生附子，生附子救急的时候，五钱都没关系，把它包在棉布袋里。煮的时候，九碗水煮三碗，一碗不过一钱多。生附子能够壮里阳，心脏里面的阳，把心脏的阳会强起来，所以把心脏的阳强起来并不是炮附子，而是炮附子。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生硫磺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，硫磺是黄色的，三焦系统，命门火就是黄色的，脏腑中间是黄色的，三焦是水道出焉，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"排水的系统要靠硫磺，所以说治水肿的时候，麻黄加术汤，我加一点点硫磺下去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，水肿很快就退了。用硫磺你用到六钱八钱，一两都没有关系。硫磺实际上并没有毒，他的毒只是热的毒，所以硫磺吃下去很热。过去水肿，全身积水都在用硫磺，脚没有力的时候会用硫磺，硫磺是补命门火的。道家有个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"金液丹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那就是硫磺提炼出来的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生硫磺取它的迅捷，速度很快。可以把生硫磺跟附子包在一起。附子黑黑的，生硫磺黄黄的，一个入肾一个入三焦命门，配上补气建中汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。下去小便还排不出来也就只有认了，因为这个方已经很强了嘛，不行就没办法了。你如果会针灸更好。我治病人肝硬化水肿，连续两次，就是分消汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-zz0ynsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-zz0ynsv","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上，肾脏病水肿，也是肿的肚子大，肾脏衰竭，整个脚都肿到，手也开始肿。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾脏病的水肿跟肝病的水肿不太一样"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘淡渗利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘淡渗利为阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个，我的病人啊，他水肿，他妈妈念经啊，做梦，梦到佛跟他说要吃绿豆，可是他买了绿豆来吃，他跟女儿吃完就一直上厕所，老太太还是不上厕所；怎么办？绿豆甘淡渗利也没错，不管用的话，有个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四神汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，专门用在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾脏病积水的时候"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，四神汤："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芡实，莲子，薏仁，白果"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我有时候白果改成淮山。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"冬天的时候绿豆改成红豆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，加点"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"龙眼肉，海盐，蔗糖"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天然的糖。夏天的时候，绿豆和四神汤混在一起的时候，煮成稀饭。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘淡渗利的时候是阳，用在肾脏积水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。临床上这样做的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-f04n9nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-f04n9nt","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般来说，这种病从开始得病都是我们中医动手，不会有这种结果的，这种结果的出现都是失治导致。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-ffw8u2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-ffw8u2i","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果处方下去，病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最迟三天"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便就开始排。如果小便没有出来，堵到里面，严重起来，有几种变化，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，会成为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十枣汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。有十枣汤症的时候，一定要确定病人还有元气，趁有元气的时候赶快下去。十枣汤把肺里面的痰水统统排掉。病人是但坐不得卧。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-fx9ao6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-fx9ao6p","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6——4"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-5vsygv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-5vsygv1","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"躺下去不断的咳嗽。十枣汤攻下去病人会上吐下泻，当时病人的状况，就"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"好像一根空的吸管插到水里面去，按主头这边下面的水就不会下去，吸管上面的口一空，下面的水立即就能排掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个时候都是在利小便，张仲景说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"下痢则"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"死。你如果攻大便就死掉了，你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一定要把小便攻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出来。如果不是十枣汤，梗在里面，过去经方家有用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘遂，牵牛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。甘遂牵牛等量，不是只有这两味药，这是其中两味。会用甘遂牵牛在黄帝外经提到。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加减处方，病人胸胁苦满，小柴胡汤的加减，如果病人没有胃口，没有胸胁苦满，没有恶心的现象，用桂枝汤的加减"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果病人已经"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"没有元气，打嗝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的时候，用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓四逆汤加减"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，茯苓四逆汤加上甘遂牵牛，甘遂牵牛可以各三钱，吃下去病人会大下，小便出来，呕吐。临床上病人会小便出来，但是如果西医碰过，尤其做过栓塞，效果都不好，切片更坏。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-v4bw19f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-v4bw19f","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果开始没有积水的时候，不需要去实脾。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夜一点到三点醒来，两年会看到肝癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。脸色很暗的时候，这个时候就开始动手了，眼睛周围是青色的，眼睛周围是脾土，木克土，眼周围是青色，就要开始动手，这个时候很简单，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小柴胡汤的加减，如果便秘大柴胡汤的加减，加些行肝气的药，比如玉金，龙胆草，胸胁苦满"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小柴胡汤，大便排不出来大柴胡汤，胃口不好，加点陈皮。中湿比较盛的话加些白术茯苓，如果湿很热在里面的话，你可以用茵陈蒿汤。这个时候就把它治好，不会有那种结果的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-yf3ipug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-yf3ipug","updated":"20240312144138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果治好之后，不要去检查，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可能里面还有肿瘤在里面，可是他是无害的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当你外症很好的时候你是没有病的，不要相信西医的说法。真正生病的时候，按照中医的观念看起来的话，张仲景赞成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃的简单"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，而且不要吃太多，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五分饱。随时保持一点饿的状态"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这样刺激你的胃气，胃气就会起来。这个时候你要吃很原始的食物。病治到无害的阶段就是好的，不要再去找西医检查，硬去挖病，它是无害的了，你自己给自己吓死。我救回来肝硬化腹水的病人，我跟他说，再去给西医检查，从此我就不理你。跟那个血癌小朋友一样，你只要吃西药我就不救你了，他一吃西医，耳后阴骨就出问题了，三个阴骨一出现问题，我们就知道，阴实了，里面已经结实了，阴实则死，结果死在西医医院里面了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144138-sc4tl9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144138-sc4tl9a"}},{"ID":"20240312144054-tfbjkyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-tfbjkyr","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百九十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-ky3tx52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-ky3tx52","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" 原文：「伤寒」，「哕」而腹满，视其前后，知何部不利，利之即愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-590yef8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-590yef8","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前我介绍的时候，我们有两个处方，一个分消汤，一个；补气建中汤；分消汤可以用在脾脏实症，肚子腹水的时候，比如脾脏肿大。肝癌肿的时候，补气建中汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-gw7zgaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-gw7zgaz","updated":"20240312144253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一个处方呢，我们叫做补中治湿汤。这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补中治湿汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢，就是前面的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补气建中汤，把泽泻拿掉，换当归，木通，升麻。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-bxnip1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-bxnip1w","updated":"20240312144255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"人参、白术各四钱，苍术茯苓陈皮麦冬当归木通各三钱。黄芩厚朴各二。升麻一，这个升麻可加可不加，如果病人嫌药苦，可以去之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6); font-size: 32px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-jhy2ueh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-jhy2ueh","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补中治湿汤是病人肝病到末期，没有把法了，给他一剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-gst79az","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-gst79az","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“腹满，视其前后，知何部不利”肝癌后期的时候，大小便都没有了，最重要的是小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-l8w4rco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-l8w4rco","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝肿大，肚子肿的很大，我们知道他是寒湿，所以要去强脾。甘味的药，像陈皮，茯苓苍术，白术，这种都是甘淡利湿，能够行湿，排湿的药。麦门冬润肺。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-xleenc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-xleenc6","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"制定一个处方出来，不能说只针对一个脏，一定要兼顾其他的东西"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。气虚掉了，加人参。把肺强起来，麦门冬。因为他的津液统统停在中间，这个时候肺上面没有津液了，这个小肠的津液不断的上来，中间的肝堵到了，所以停水在这个地方（治肝以下），因为肝横逆在中间。会用当归代表病人血虚了，内脏有病的时候，不管是脾脏、肝脏、心脏都会有血虚的现象，久病也有虚，所以加当归补气补血。木通就是大便不通，大便不通的时候，又不能用大黄去攻，厥阴症的时候不能攻下，里寒盛的时候，一攻下死掉了。病人有虚热，肠子气往上逆，加黄芩厚朴，希望能宽肠，让肠气往下走，同时黄芩里面有宿食的话，它能够解毒。这个处方如果下去，小便出来就有救。那就要增强它，怎么增强，就要靠热药。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-epaww3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-epaww3h","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"整个厥阴篇讲，热多比较好，寒多不好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"补中治湿汤，加生附子五钱。生硫磺可以用到七钱。附子生硫磺用棉布包起来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当行气利湿的时候，水已经很盛了，整个三焦都堵到了，很重，里寒很盛。我们希望热药能够进入身体的中心去，把寒湿化掉，但光是行湿，可能外面湿排掉，里面寒湿可能还是有，所以会使用到生附子。因为生附子能够强心，心脏和小肠这一段靠生附子去强他，生硫磺从命门到三焦，生硫磺平时治疗水肿，硫磺放一点下去，全身冒汗，水肿就退掉了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"能够点命门火的药，最好的药就是生硫磺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生硫磺下去以后，命门火会起来，阳气会起来，阳气在走的时候，再配合行气治湿的药的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"能够一搏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人便秘，绝对不能用大黄芒硝，用就死"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以用木通。临床上看木通的时候，心脏热要移热到小肠，木通很好用，当归四逆汤也有木通。小肠很冷的时候，小肠的蠕动靠木通，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"木通除了通小便，还能通大便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，对大便也很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-gcdj2go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-gcdj2go","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原方补中治湿汤用了很多年，但是加生附子、生硫磺下去，药性就大增。做最后一搏。如果病人恶心，呕吐，吃不下去，就用吴茱萸，生姜来不及了用干姜，吴茱萸可以用四钱五钱，干姜三钱。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"千万不放甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"排腹水的时候，甘草，大黄，芒硝都不用，因为厥阴篇忌下，绝对不能攻下的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-qy5xba9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-qy5xba9","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分消汤，脾脏肿大，腹水很快。肝脏就很难。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-jpixucb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-jpixucb","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治癌症的时候，第一要求，不要病人做任何的检查的动作，不要做切片栓塞，什么都不要做。第二个要求就是，不要回去做体检了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。中医得标准是，里面可能还有其他的变症在里面，可是这个人能吃能喝能拉能睡，即使肝癌的肿瘤还在，可能十年才长指甲那么大一个，你就不要小题大做了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312144054-xknb5qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312144054-xknb5qw","updated":"20240312144054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"以上讲的是厥阴证。"}]}]}